## The one status word a status badge says beside its tone.

## Where an action a repository declares stands for a finalized commit.

tones-reach-reached = Reached
tones-reach-not-yet = Waiting
tones-reach-failed = Failed
tones-reach-rolled-back = Rolled back
tones-reach-unknown = Unknown

## Where one exchange of a conversation stands.

tones-exchange-answered = Answered
tones-exchange-queued = Queued
tones-exchange-starting = Starting
tones-exchange-working = Working
tones-exchange-waiting = Waiting
tones-exchange-failed = Failed
tones-exchange-abandoned = Abandoned
tones-exchange-stopped = Stopped
tones-exchange-open = Open
